 codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibilityValue(_:isEnabled:)-6m6ve":{"type":"topic","title":"accessibilityValue(_:isEnabled:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibilityValue(_:isEnabled:)-6m6ve","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibilityvalue(_:isenabled:)-6m6ve","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibilityValue"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LocalizedStringKey","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI18LocalizedStringKeyV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"abstract":[]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"title":"Interaction_DragView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"}}}